TITLE='Compose 深入：健康检查、依赖、profiles、多环境'
DESC='把 Compose 用到生产级别：按健康状态启动、一次性迁移任务、可选服务、多文件覆盖与变量插值、资源限制和开发时的自动同步。'
NEXT='安全（一）：rootless、capabilities、seccomp'
MIN=45
SUM=['<code>depends_on</code> 默认只等容器<b>启动</b>，不等服务<b>就绪</b>。配合 <code>healthcheck</code> 用 <code>condition: service_healthy</code>。', '一次性任务（数据库迁移）用 <code>condition: service_completed_successfully</code>，主服务在它成功退出后才启动。', '<code>profiles</code> 让调试工具、管理面板等服务默认不启动，<code>--profile debug</code> 时才启动。', '多文件：<code>compose.yaml</code> 放公共部分，<code>compose.override.yaml</code> 自动叠加（开发），<code>-f compose.yaml -f compose.prod.yaml</code> 用于生产。<code>docker compose config</code> 查看合并结果。', '变量插值：<code>${TAG:-latest}</code> 提供默认值，<code>${DB_PASSWORD:?缺少密码}</code> 缺失时直接报错。值来自 shell 环境和 <code>.env</code> 文件。', '<code>develop.watch</code>：改代码自动同步进容器，改依赖文件自动重建。']
SECS=[('启动顺序', '“容器启动了”和“服务能用了”不是一回事。', '<div id="p1"></div>'), ('多文件合并', '同一份应用，开发和生产的差异放在哪里？', '<div id="p2"></div>'), ('动手：配置依赖条件', 'web 依赖 db（Postgres 启动需要约 4 秒）和 migrate（迁移任务，约 2 秒后退出）。为每条依赖选择条件，然后启动。', '<div class="chal"><div class="cmds" id="c1"></div><div class="cmds" id="c2"></div><div class="cmds"><button class="btn pri" id="go">docker compose up</button></div><div class="log" id="lg"></div><div class="msg" id="cm"></div></div>'), ('常用命令', '检查、合并、按 profile 启动、监视。', '<div id="t4"></div>'), ('在你的电脑上练习', '一个带健康检查、迁移任务和可选管理面板的应用。', '<div class="prac"><div class="st"><span class="n">01</span><div><p>创建项目。</p><pre class="cmd">mkdir cdeep &amp;&amp; cd cdeep\ncat &gt; compose.yaml &lt;&lt;&#x27;EOF&#x27;\nservices:\n  db:\n    image: postgres:16\n    environment:\n      POSTGRES_PASSWORD: ${DB_PASSWORD:?set DB_PASSWORD}\n    healthcheck:\n      test: [&quot;CMD-SHELL&quot;, &quot;pg_isready -U postgres&quot;]\n      interval: 2s\n      retries: 15\n  migrate:\n    image: postgres:16\n    command: psql -h db -U postgres -c &quot;CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS t(id int)&quot;\n    environment:\n      PGPASSWORD: ${DB_PASSWORD}\n    depends_on:\n      db: { condition: service_healthy }\n  web:\n    image: nginx:alpine\n    ports: [&quot;${WEB_PORT:-8080}:80&quot;]\n    depends_on:\n      migrate: { condition: service_completed_successfully }\n  adminer:\n    image: adminer\n    ports: [&quot;8081:8080&quot;]\n    profiles: [debug]\nEOF\ndocker compose config &gt;/dev/null</pre><pre class="out">error while interpolating services.db.environment.POSTGRES_PASSWORD: required variable DB_PASSWORD is missing a value: set DB_PASSWORD</pre></div></div><div class="st"><span class="n">02</span><div><p>用 .env 提供变量，再检查。</p><pre class="cmd">echo &quot;DB_PASSWORD=devpass&quot; &gt; .env\ndocker compose config --services</pre><pre class="out">db\nmigrate\nweb</pre></div></div><div class="st"><span class="n">03</span><div><p>启动，观察顺序。adminer 不在其中。</p><pre class="cmd">docker compose up -d</pre><pre class="out">✔ Container cdeep-db-1       Healthy\n✔ Container cdeep-migrate-1  Exited\n✔ Container cdeep-web-1      Started</pre></div></div><div class="st"><span class="n">04</span><div><p>确认迁移成功。</p><pre class="cmd">docker compose ps -a --format &quot;{{.Service}} {{.Status}}&quot;</pre><pre class="out">db Up 12 seconds (healthy)\nmigrate Exited (0) 8 seconds ago\nweb Up 7 seconds</pre></div></div><div class="st"><span class="n">05</span><div><p>按 profile 启动管理面板。</p><pre class="cmd">docker compose --profile debug up -d\ndocker compose ps --format &quot;{{.Service}}&quot;</pre><pre class="out">adminer\ndb\nweb</pre></div></div><div class="st"><span class="n">06</span><div><p>清理。</p><pre class="cmd">docker compose --profile debug down -v</pre><pre class="out">✔ Network cdeep_default  Removed</pre></div></div></div><div class="task2"><div class="k">挑战</div><h3>生产覆盖文件</h3><p>新增 <code>compose.prod.yaml</code>：web 改为 80 端口、设置 <code>restart: unless-stopped</code>、限制 web 内存 128M，db 加一个命名卷。用 <code>-f</code> 合并后查看结果，确认 web 的内存限制生效。</p><details><summary>查看参考答案</summary><div><pre class="cmd">cat > compose.prod.yaml <<\'EOF\'\nservices:\n  web:\n    ports: !override ["80:80"]\n    restart: unless-stopped\n    deploy:\n      resources:\n        limits: { memory: 128M }\n  db:\n    restart: unless-stopped\n    volumes: [pgdata:/var/lib/postgresql/data]\nvolumes:\n  pgdata:\nEOF\ndocker compose -f compose.yaml -f compose.prod.yaml config | grep -A3 "limits"\ndocker compose -f compose.yaml -f compose.prod.yaml up -d\ndocker inspect cdeep-web-1 -f "{{.HostConfig.Memory}}"</pre><pre class="out">          memory: "134217728"\n134217728</pre><p>列表类字段（ports）默认是<b>追加</b>合并，所以用 <code>!override</code> 替换而不是同时映射 8080 和 80。标量字段（restart）直接覆盖。也可以设置 <code>COMPOSE_FILE=compose.yaml:compose.prod.yaml</code>，省去每次写 <code>-f</code>。</p></div></details></div>'), ('自测', '选完显示解释。答错可以再选。', '<div id="qs"></div>')]
JSV=''
def secs(prac,E): return SECS
